{% comment %}
  Section: Countdown
  Compte a rebours jusqu'a une date et une heure donnees (fuseau de la boutique)
  Le premier rendu est calcule cote Liquid pour eviter un flash de chiffres vides,
  puis un script inline prend le relais et recale l'affichage sur l'horloge du visiteur.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign target_date = section.settings.target_date | strip
  assign target_time = section.settings.target_time | strip

  if target_time == blank
    assign target_time = '00:00'
  endif

  assign target_ts = 0
  if target_date != blank
    assign target_string = target_date | append: ' ' | append: target_time
    assign target_ts = target_string | date: '%s' | times: 1
  endif

  assign now_ts = 'now' | date: '%s' | times: 1

  assign has_target = false
  assign remaining = 0
  if target_ts > 0
    assign has_target = true
    assign remaining = target_ts | minus: now_ts
  endif

  assign is_expired = false
  if has_target and remaining <= 0
    assign is_expired = true
    assign remaining = 0
  endif

  assign days = remaining | divided_by: 86400
  assign day_rest = remaining | modulo: 86400
  assign hours = day_rest | divided_by: 3600
  assign hour_rest = day_rest | modulo: 3600
  assign minutes = hour_rest | divided_by: 60
  assign seconds = hour_rest | modulo: 60

  assign days_display = days
  if days < 10
    assign days_display = days | prepend: '0'
  endif
  assign hours_display = hours
  if hours < 10
    assign hours_display = hours | prepend: '0'
  endif
  assign minutes_display = minutes
  if minutes < 10
    assign minutes_display = minutes | prepend: '0'
  endif
  assign seconds_display = seconds
  if seconds < 10
    assign seconds_display = seconds | prepend: '0'
  endif

  assign summary_now = 'sections.countdown.summary' | t: days: days, hours: hours, minutes: minutes
  assign summary_template = 'sections.countdown.summary' | t: days: '%D', hours: '%H', minutes: '%M'

  assign expired_announcement = section.settings.expired_message | strip
  if expired_announcement == blank
    assign expired_announcement = 'sections.countdown.finished' | t
  endif

  assign region_label = 'sections.countdown.aria_label' | t

  comment
    En expiration, la section disparait cote boutique si le marchand l'a demande,
    mais reste visible dans l'editeur pour rester modifiable.
  endcomment
  assign render_section = true
  if is_expired and section.settings.hide_when_expired
    unless request.design_mode
      assign render_section = false
    endunless
  endif

  assign digit_surface = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text | color_mix: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background, 8
  comment
    L'etiquette d'une unite (« Days ») est peinte sur digit_surface, la surface
    de la case, pas sur le fond de la section : --color-text-light, derive sur
    le fond, y perdait le rapport annonce. On la redérive sur digit_surface.
  endcomment
  capture digit_muted
    render 'contrast-color', base: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text, bg: digit_surface, target: 4.6
  endcapture
  assign digit_muted = digit_muted | strip
  assign digit_border = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text | color_mix: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background, 22

  comment
    digits_color etait pose TEL QUEL, alors que l'etiquette voisine est derivee
    (digit_muted, juste au-dessus). Mesure 1.7.2, section a fond clair posee
    (#fdfdfd) et digits_color laisse a son defaut #ffffff : les chiffres
    tombaient a 1,19:1 sur digit_surface #ebebeb (52 px, seuil 3) et l'anneau de
    .countdown__button ne changeait AUCUN pixel au seuil (px3 0 sur 1 096
    requis, anneau blanc a 1,02:1 sur le fond) — donc aucun focus visible.

    Deux cibles differentes, parce que les deux encres ne sont pas posees sur le
    meme fond : les chiffres et le pretitre sont peints sur digit_surface, la
    surface de la case ; l'anneau de focus est trace a 3 px DEHORS du bouton,
    donc sur le fond de la section. Seuil 3 dans les deux cas (grand texte pour
    les chiffres, composant d'interface pour l'anneau).
  endcomment
  capture digit_ink
    render 'contrast-color', base: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text, bg: digit_surface, target: 3.2
  endcapture
  assign digit_ink = digit_ink | strip
  capture digit_ring
    render 'contrast-color', base: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text, bg: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background, target: 3.2
  endcapture
  assign digit_ring = digit_ring | strip

  comment
    Le pretitre, lui, est peint sur le FOND DE LA SECTION et non sur la surface
    d'une case : digit_ink, derive pour digit_surface, n'y tient pas le rapport
    annonce (verifier-theme le refuse — « encres derivees posees sur le fond de
    leur derivation », le defaut paye sur LUMIERE 1.6.2 et 1.6.3). Il fait
    0,75rem, donc du petit texte : cible 4,6 et non 3.
  endcomment
  capture digit_pretitle
    render 'contrast-color', base: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text, bg: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background, target: 4.6
  endcapture
  assign digit_pretitle = digit_pretitle | strip
-%}

{%- style -%}
  .countdown {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background }};
    {% render 'section-tokens', bg: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background, text: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text, accent: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.accent, scheme: section.settings.color_scheme %}
  }

  /* .countdown__timer declare display: grid : sans cette regle l'attribut
     hidden serait neutralise par la declaration de display. */
  .countdown[hidden],
  .countdown [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .countdown__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .countdown__pretitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ digit_pretitle }};
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .countdown__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text }};
  }

  .countdown__text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: var(--spacing-sm) auto 0;
  }

  .countdown__timer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: var(--spacing-lg) auto 0;
  }

  .countdown__unit {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-sm);
    background-color: {{ digit_surface }};
    border: 1px solid {{ digit_border }};
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .countdown__value {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
    color: {{ digit_ink }};
  }

  .countdown__value--tick {
    animation: countdown-tick 0.28s ease-out;
  }

  @keyframes countdown-tick {
    from {
      opacity: 0.35;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .countdown__label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    /* Derivee sur digit_surface, la surface de la case, et non sur le fond de
       la section : voir le commentaire du bloc {%- liquid -%} en tete. */
    color: {{ digit_muted }};
  }

  .countdown__expired {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: {{ section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text }};
    margin: var(--spacing-lg) auto 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .countdown__button {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .countdown__button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid {{ digit_ring }};
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .countdown__timer {
      gap: var(--spacing-xs);
      margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .countdown__unit {
      padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-xs);
    }

    .countdown__label {
      font-size: 0.625rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .countdown__value--tick {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- if render_section -%}
  <div
    class="countdown color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
    id="Countdown-{{ section.id }}"
    data-countdown="{{ section.id }}"
    data-target="{{ target_ts }}"
    data-hide-expired="{% if section.settings.hide_when_expired %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
    data-design-mode="{% if request.design_mode %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
    role="region"
    aria-label="{{ region_label }}"
  >
    <div class="countdown__inner">
      {%- if section.settings.pretitle != blank -%}
        <p class="countdown__pretitle">{{ section.settings.pretitle | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
        <h2 class="countdown__title">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
        <p class="countdown__text">{{ section.settings.text | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div
        class="countdown__timer"
        data-countdown-timer
        role="timer"
        aria-live="off"
        {% if is_expired or has_target == false %}hidden{% endif %}
      >
        <div class="countdown__unit">
          <span class="countdown__value" data-unit="days">{{ days_display }}</span>
          <span class="countdown__label">{{ 'sections.countdown.days' | t }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown__unit">
          <span class="countdown__value" data-unit="hours">{{ hours_display }}</span>
          <span class="countdown__label">{{ 'sections.countdown.hours' | t }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown__unit">
          <span class="countdown__value" data-unit="minutes">{{ minutes_display }}</span>
          <span class="countdown__label">{{ 'sections.countdown.minutes' | t }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown__unit">
          <span class="countdown__value" data-unit="seconds">{{ seconds_display }}</span>
          <span class="countdown__label">{{ 'sections.countdown.seconds' | t }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Les chiffres ne sont jamais annonces (aria-live="off" sur role="timer").
        Ce resume, lui, est mis a jour une fois par minute seulement.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p
        class="visually-hidden"
        data-countdown-summary
        data-template="{{ summary_template | escape }}"
        data-expired-text="{{ expired_announcement | escape }}"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
        {%- if is_expired -%}
          {{ expired_announcement }}
        {%- else -%}
          {{ summary_now }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>

      {%- comment -%}
        Le message de fin est celui du marchand, sinon la phrase traduite du
        theme : a zero, le compte a rebours dit qu'il est termine.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="countdown__expired" data-countdown-expired {% unless is_expired %}hidden{% endunless %}>
        {{- expired_announcement | escape -}}
      </p>

      {%- if has_target == false and request.design_mode -%}
        <p class="editor-empty">{{ 'sections.countdown.no_date' | t }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.button_label != blank and section.settings.button_link != blank -%}
        <a
          class="btn btn--primary countdown__button"
          href="{% render 'lien-localise', url: section.settings.button_link %}"
        >
          {{- section.settings.button_label | escape -}}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if has_target and is_expired == false -%}
    <script>
      (function () {
        var sectionId = {{ section.id | json }};
        var root = document.querySelector('[data-countdown="' + sectionId + '"]');
        if (!root) return;

        /* Idempotence : si la section est rechargee dans l'editeur le noeud est neuf ;
           si ce script est evalue deux fois sur le meme noeud, on sort. */
        if (root.dataset.countdownInit === 'true') return;
        root.dataset.countdownInit = 'true';

        var targetSeconds = parseInt(root.getAttribute('data-target'), 10);
        if (!targetSeconds) return;

        var targetMs = targetSeconds * 1000;
        var hideOnExpiry = root.getAttribute('data-hide-expired') === 'true';
        var designMode = root.getAttribute('data-design-mode') === 'true';

        var timerEl = root.querySelector('[data-countdown-timer]');
        var summaryEl = root.querySelector('[data-countdown-summary]');
        var expiredEl = root.querySelector('[data-countdown-expired]');

        var summaryTemplate = summaryEl ? summaryEl.getAttribute('data-template') || '' : '';
        var expiredText = summaryEl ? summaryEl.getAttribute('data-expired-text') || '' : '';

        var units = {
          days: root.querySelector('[data-unit="days"]'),
          hours: root.querySelector('[data-unit="hours"]'),
          minutes: root.querySelector('[data-unit="minutes"]'),
          seconds: root.querySelector('[data-unit="seconds"]')
        };

        var motionQuery =
          window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
        var prefersReducedMotion = motionQuery ? motionQuery.matches : false;
        if (motionQuery && typeof motionQuery.addEventListener === 'function') {
          motionQuery.addEventListener('change', function (event) {
            prefersReducedMotion = event.matches;
          });
        }

        var interval = null;
        var lastMinute = {{ minutes }};

        function pad(value) {
          return value < 10 ? '0' + value : String(value);
        }

        function setUnit(element, value) {
          if (!element) return;
          var text = pad(value);
          if (element.textContent === text) return;
          element.textContent = text;
          if (prefersReducedMotion) return;
          element.classList.remove('countdown__value--tick');
          /* Reflow force : sans lui la classe reposee dans la meme frame ne rejoue pas. */
          void element.offsetWidth;
          element.classList.add('countdown__value--tick');
        }

        function updateSummary(days, hours, minutes) {
          if (!summaryEl || !summaryTemplate) return;
          summaryEl.textContent = summaryTemplate
            .split('%D')
            .join(days)
            .split('%H')
            .join(hours)
            .split('%M')
            .join(minutes);
        }

        function stop() {
          if (interval !== null) {
            clearInterval(interval);
            interval = null;
          }
        }

        function expire() {
          stop();
          setUnit(units.days, 0);
          setUnit(units.hours, 0);
          setUnit(units.minutes, 0);
          setUnit(units.seconds, 0);

          if (summaryEl && expiredText) summaryEl.textContent = expiredText;

          if (hideOnExpiry && !designMode) {
            root.hidden = true;
            return;
          }

          if (timerEl) timerEl.hidden = true;
          if (expiredEl) expiredEl.hidden = false;
        }

        function tick() {
          /* Recalcul complet a chaque passage : l'affichage se recale tout seul
             apres une mise en veille ou un onglet laisse en arriere-plan. */
          var remaining = Math.floor((targetMs - Date.now()) / 1000);

          if (remaining <= 0) {
            expire();
            return;
          }

          var days = Math.floor(remaining / 86400);
          var hours = Math.floor((remaining % 86400) / 3600);
          var minutes = Math.floor((remaining % 3600) / 60);
          var seconds = remaining % 60;

          setUnit(units.days, days);
          setUnit(units.hours, hours);
          setUnit(units.minutes, minutes);
          setUnit(units.seconds, seconds);

          if (minutes !== lastMinute) {
            lastMinute = minutes;
            updateSummary(days, hours, minutes);
          }
        }

        tick();
        if (interval === null && !root.hidden) {
          interval = setInterval(tick, 1000);
        }

        document.addEventListener('shopify:section:unload', function (event) {
          if (event.detail && event.detail.sectionId === sectionId) stop();
        });
      })();
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.countdown.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-countdown",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.countdown.settings.header__1.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "target_date",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.target_date.label",
      "info": "t:sections.countdown.settings.target_date.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "target_time",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.target_time.label",
      "info": "t:sections.countdown.settings.target_time.info",
      "default": "23:59"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.countdown.settings.header__2.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pretitle",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.pretitle.label",
      "default": "Limited offer"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.title.label",
      "default": "The private sale ends in"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.text.label",
      "default": "Our seasonal selection is available until the timer runs out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.button_label.label",
      "default": "See the selection"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.button_link.label",
      "info": "t:sections.countdown.settings.button_link.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.countdown.settings.header__3.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "expired_message",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.expired_message.label",
      "info": "t:sections.countdown.settings.expired_message.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hide_when_expired",
      "label": "t:sections.countdown.settings.hide_when_expired.label",
      "info": "t:sections.countdown.settings.hide_when_expired.info",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.countdown.settings.header__4.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:settings_schema.couleurs.settings.color_scheme.label",
      "info": "t:settings_schema.couleurs.settings.color_scheme.info",
      "default": "scheme-4"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.countdown.presets.name",
      "category": "t:categories.promotional"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
